 "rules": "// A thread: a name on its own line,\n// then indented patterns. A pattern is\n// part of a merchant name, a #tag\n// from your notes, or a /regex/.\n// First matching thread wins.\n\nBills [budget 300/month]\n  brightwell energy\n  willow water\n  cloudfern internet\n\nGroceries [budget 300/month]\n  harbor pantry\n\nDining out [budget 100/month]\n  paper kite cafe\n\nGetting around [budget 100/month]\n  loopway transit\n\nSubscriptions [budget 50/month]\n  lantern stream\n\nPets [budget 120/month]\n  meadow paws\n  #pets\n\nHome\n  oak & loom\n  #home\n\nTrips\n  lantern bay\n  #trip\n",
 "notes": {
  "demo-2026-06-demo-everyday-4": "Supplies for Pixel, our fictional demo cat. #pets",
  "demo-2026-07-demo-everyday-4": "Supplies for Pixel, our fictional demo cat. #pets",
  "demo-2026-08-demo-everyday-4": "Supplies for Pixel, our fictional demo cat. #pets",
  "demo-2026-08-demo-card-6": "A made-up desk for the reading corner. #home",
  "demo-2026-08-demo-card-7": "Fictional weekend away. #trip"
 },
